# 🏦 11. Contract Balance

We can create a function to check the contract's Ether balance.

```solidity
function getContractBalance()
    external
    view
    returns(uint256)
{
    return address(this).balance;
}
```

---

## Example

Suppose:

```text
Alice deposits 2 ETH
Bob deposits 3 ETH
```

Then:

```text
Contract Balance = 5 ETH
```

Conceptually:

```text
Alice ──2 ETH──┐
               │
Bob ───3 ETH───┤
               ▼
        ┌──────────────┐
        │   Contract   │
        │              │
        │   5 ETH      │
        └──────────────┘
```

