# 💸 15. Deposit vs Contract Balance

This distinction is important.

When a user sends:

```text
1 ETH
```

the contract receives the Ether.

At the same time:

```text
msg.value = 1 ETH
```

and after the call:

```text
address(this).balance
```

includes that Ether.

---

## Example

Before deposit:

```text
Contract balance = 0 ETH
```

Alice sends:

```text
1 ETH
```

During the call:

```text
msg.value = 1 ETH
```

